    "Fast translates a volume in about a minute. Accurate reads idioms and nuance better but takes about 20 times as long. Each mode downloads its own language packs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fast translates a volume in about a minute. Accurate reads idioms and nuance better but takes about 20 times as long. Each mode downloads its own language packs."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "빠르게는 한 권을 1분 정도에 번역합니다. 정확하게는 관용 표현과 뉘앙스를 더 잘 옮기지만 20배 정도 오래 걸립니다. 방식마다 언어팩을 따로 내려받습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
