    "Language packs are downloaded from the translation panel the first time a book is translated. Manage downloaded packs in System Settings › General › Language & Region › Translation Languages." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Language packs are downloaded from the translation panel the first time a book is translated. Manage downloaded packs in System Settings › General › Language & Region › Translation Languages."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "언어팩은 책을 처음 번역할 때 번역 패널에서 받습니다. 받은 언어팩은 시스템 설정 › 일반 › 언어 및 지역 › 번역 언어에서 관리할 수 있습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language packs are large, so this can take several minutes. The progress bar in the system window may not move for a while." : {
