            "value" : "번역이 중단되었습니다: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation was stopped before the book was finished." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Translation was stopped before the book was finished."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "책을 다 번역하기 전에 번역이 중지되었습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translations and exports show here while they run, and exported books stay listed. Export a book from the translation menu in the toolbar, File › Export Translated Book…, or a book's or folder's context menu in the library." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Translations and exports show here while they run, and exported books stay listed. Export a book from the translation menu in the toolbar, File › Export Translated Book…, or a book's or folder's context menu in the library."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "번역과 내보내기가 진행되는 동안 여기에 표시되고, 내보낸 책도 목록에 남습니다. 툴바의 번역 메뉴, 파일 › 번역본 내보내기…, 또는 라이브러리에서 책이나 폴더의 우클릭 메뉴로 내보낼 수 있습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translations you rewrote, originals you corrected and balloons you hid. They're kept apart from the cache, so clearing it or translating again keeps them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Translations you rewrote, originals you corrected and balloons you hid. They're kept apart from the cache, so clearing it or translating again keeps them."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "직접 고친 번역, 고친 원문, 숨긴 말풍선입니다. 캐시와 따로 저장되므로 캐시를 지우거나 다시 번역해도 유지됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
